---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Insights
description: Notes from Mindfizz on information design, presentation design, visual explanation and communicating complex material.
navKey: insights
pagination:
  data: collections.insights
  size: 12
  alias: posts
  reverse: true
permalink: "{% if pagination.pageNumber == 0 %}/insights/index.html{% else %}/insights/page/{{ pagination.pageNumber + 1 }}/index.html{% endif %}"
---
<header class="page-hero page-hero-split">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Insights</p><h1>Notes on making complex material clear<span class="red-stop">.</span></h1></div>
  <p class="page-lede">A journal about information design, presentations, evidence, structure and the choices that sit behind clear visual communication.</p>
</header>

<section class="insights-list">
  {% for post in posts %}
  <article class="insight-card fade-in">
    <div><time datetime="{{ post.date | htmlDateString }}">{{ post.date | readableDate }}</time><span>{{ post.data.topic }}</span></div>
    <h2><a href="{{ post.url }}">{{ post.data.title }}</a></h2>
    <p>{{ post.data.description }}</p>
    <a class="text-link" href="{{ post.url }}">Read insight ↗</a>
  </article>
  {% else %}
  <div class="empty-state"><h2>The journal is taking shape.</h2><p>New notes on information design and complex communication will appear here.</p></div>
  {% endfor %}
</section>
